 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2021-11-23",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Revenue currently trading ahead of full year expectations, enabling digital investment",
   "file": "20211123_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-01",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "While ongoing efficiencies are expected to partly mitigate this impact, we anticipate the net effect to be a modest year-on-year reduction in operating profit as we continue to invest for the future.",
   "file": "20220301_RCH_Annual-Results-for-52-weeks-ended-26-December-2021.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-05",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "However, since the middle of March, we have seen further inflation in operating costs, particularly within print, where the impact of newsprint (paper cost) increases will now exceed our previous expectations.",
   "file": "20220505_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-26",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "We currently expect management actions and the natural phasing of our business, to support a stronger than historical H2 profit contribution.",
   "file": "20220726_RCH_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-10-11",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Although the unusual period of trading during September impacted revenue and profit, underlying revenue trends during Q3 were broadly as anticipated heading into Q4, historically the strongest period for advertising.",
   "file": "20221011_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-11",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Lower than forecast group revenue in Q4 and the less profitable revenue mix of stronger circulation but lower advertising, is expected to impact profit and the Board now expects operating profit for FY22 will be below the current market consensus3 by mid-single digits %.",
   "file": "20230111_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-07",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "While external factors are affecting near term performance, consistent strategic delivery is supporting the growth of higher quality digital revenues, which with our US expansion, puts us in a strong position to grow when macro headwinds subside. Profit expectations for the full year are in line with the current market consensus(3).",
   "file": "20230307_RCH_Annual-Results-for-52-weeks-ended-25-December-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-03",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Profit expectations for FY23 remain in-line with market consensus.(1)",
   "file": "20230503_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-25",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Plans to reduce full year operating costs by 5-6% are on track with H2 weighted savings supporting profit expectations for 2023 which remain in-line with the current market consensus.(5)",
   "file": "20230725_RCH_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-10",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We remain confident of meeting profit expectations for the full year.4 We do not anticipate the market backdrop to change materially in the near term and as a result we remain focused on the areas within our control; improving customer engagement, diversifying revenues and driving efficiencies.",
   "file": "20231010_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-03-05",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "Trading performance across the first two months of 2024 has been robust, with print advertising and digital performing well and we are on track with our full year outlook but we continue to operate in an uncertain macroeconomic environment.",
   "file": "20240305_RCH_Annual-Results-for-53-weeks-ended-31-December-2023.md",
   "gnote": "early signal: first step up in tone"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-05-02",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading remains robust in what is a challenging environment, and we remain on track to deliver full year expectations.2",
   "file": "20240502_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-07-31",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "As we have seen, this dynamic can create some volatility across our distribution, however, we are building more resilience through our Customer Value Strategy and we remain on track to deliver market expectations.(6)",
   "file": "20240731_RCH_Reach-plc---Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-10-15",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We remain confident in delivering expectations for the full year2. We continue to monitor the impact from the tech platforms' actions on referral volumes, and we expect further digital growth in Q4.",
   "file": "20241015_RCH_Reach-plc---Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-01-20",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "As a result, we now expect to deliver results ahead of current market expectations for the full year.¹",
   "file": "20250120_RCH_Reach-plc---Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-03-04",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading performance across the first two months of 2025 has been encouraging, supported by growing audience numbers. The Group is confident of delivering in line with current market expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20250304_RCH_Annual-Results-for-year-ended-31-December-2024.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-05-01",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst there are no immediate direct impacts from the recent tariff announcements we recognise the heightened levels of macroeconomic uncertainty. We remain on track to deliver in line with market expectations for the full year.1",
   "file": "20250501_RCH_Reach-plc---Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-07-24",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst July's referral volumes were impacted by Google's recent core update, we remain confident in delivering market expectations for the full year.(6)",
   "file": "20250724_RCH_Reach-plc---Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2025-10-14",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We anticipate full year digital revenues to be broadly flat on the prior year, reflecting the ongoing volatility in referral volumes and weak macroeconomic backdrop. We remain confident in delivering market expectations for the year.2",
   "file": "20251014_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-01-20",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Alongside strategic progress, the resilient performance of our print business and continued cost control means that we expect to deliver ahead of current market expectations for the full year.¹",
   "file": "20260120_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-03-03",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We are on track to deliver market expectations for the full year, which is underpinned by a 5-6% reduction in adjusted operating costs.(4)",
   "file": "20260303_RCH_Annual-Results-for-year-ended-31-December-2025.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2026-05-06",
   "doc": "Q1 TU",
   "fy": "FY26",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "While on-platform audiences are showing signs of stabilisation, we continue to be cautious on digital revenues. We remain confident in delivering the reduction in operating costs, and are on track to deliver in line with market expectations for the full year.2",
   "file": "20260506_RCH_Trading-Update.md"
